== Description ==

'''Copper Wire''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Anvil]]. It appears as an ingredient in 4 downstream recipes at the [[Electronics Workbench]], including [[Simple Generator]], [[Transformer]], [[Electrical Wire]], [[Simple Motor]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

